            "review_text": "Jimi B\nPortland, Oregon83 contributions\n0\nBird's eye view of river traffic\nJan 2018 • Couples\nThe roof-top bar at the Hotel Majestic is legendary, so it was a must to visit. The views are grand and the roof top guarantees cooler temperatures than street level. My husband, who has been here many times, was disappointed the two levels above the Breeze Sky Bar were no longer accessible . The drinks were very good, but I had THE BEST egg rolls I have ever had. I'd go back in a heartbeat.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 6, 2018",
