            "review_text": "Little_Bird2003\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia104 contributions\n0\nNice scenery\nApr 2017 • Business\nHad breakfast here while staying at Hotel Majestic Saigon. The breakfast buffet spread was quite extensive but the food was so-so. I really thought they could do better with fruits especially. The buffet is layed out indoor and also outdoor. This makes no sense if you want the comfort of aircond indoor as the sheer number of people coming in and out of the bar let to hot air from outside to come in. Otherwise, the view from the Bar is very good. You can enjoy the Saigon River view and beyond.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 15, 2017",
