            "review_title": "Review at Breeze Sky Bar",
            "review_text": "Sally O\nSydney, Australia61 contributions\n0\nGreat food, great view, great service\nMay 2017 • Friends\nWent here for a drink and ended staying for dinner which was a delicious bbq buffet. The bar is on the 5th floor of the Majestic Hotel. It may not be the highest sky bar but it has great views of the river and a nice breeze. The drinks were quite strong so you get your money's worth. The buffet has it all. I had 2 lobsters as well as other assorted goodies for dinner. My friends had steak which they said was really good. The dress code appeared to be quite casual and we all had shorts on. We found the service to be great.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 10, 2017",
